(7588303, 1222656, 96751, '<td valign="top">Well, that is most certainly a vanished point :)<br/> <br/>I''m completely conflicted about this entry. It is magnificent: delicate, gentle, and so pretty. But vanishing point is an actual thing, and this does not represent that.</td>', 'Well, that is most certainly a vanished point :) I''m completely conflicted about this entry. It is magnificent: delicate, gentle, and so pretty. But vanishing point is an actual thing, and this does not represent that.', '2018-08-01 22:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
