(7588308, 1222814, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the choices and the setting. But I actually had to search for the vanishing point. For me, the lighting doesn''t do anything to help the shot - it''s all too even in tones. I think some vignetting, and some dodging could have really helped lead the eye better.</td>', 'I love the choices and the setting. But I actually had to search for the vanishing point. For me, the lighting doesn''t do anything to help the shot - it''s all too even in tones. I think some vignetting, and some dodging could have really helped lead the eye better.', '2018-08-01 22:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7588309, 1222611, 96751, '<td valign="top">What am I looking at????? Clearly not a rice paddy... Really beautiful. For me, though, while a magnificent image, this is not an example of "vanishing point"</td>', 'What am I looking at????? Clearly not a rice paddy... Really beautiful. For me, though, while a magnificent image, this is not an example of "vanishing point"', '2018-08-01 22:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7588310, 1221771, 96751, '<td valign="top">Incredibly spiritual. Blessing of the birds.</td>', 'Incredibly spiritual. Blessing of the birds.', '2018-08-01 22:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7588313, 1222750, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very painterly. I don''t know that the softened details helps sell the vanishing point. Maybe if the road had been dodged a bit...?</td>', 'Very painterly. I don''t know that the softened details helps sell the vanishing point. Maybe if the road had been dodged a bit...?', '2018-08-01 22:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
