(7590921, 1222611, 194290, '<td valign="top">probably not as well are some others in the challenge, but the canal is parallel and never meets, but appears to meet in the pic and hence i choose this entry as i wanted something different to the routine pics we will get to see of a vanishing point. Thank you for the comment. i will update about the place in the image description.<table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ecmguy:</b></div><hr/><i> Doesn''t fit the bill of ''vanishing point'' as well as some of the others in this challenge, but it''s an absolutely amazing photograph in its own right.  7 from me, and I''d love to know more about this place after the challenge! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'probably not as well are some others in the challenge, but the canal is parallel and never meets, but appears to meet in the pic and hence i choose this entry as i wanted something different to the routine pics we will get to see of a vanishing point. Thank you for the comment. i will update about the place in the image description.Originally posted by ecmguy: Doesn''t fit the bill of ''vanishing point'' as well as some of the others in this challenge, but it''s an absolutely amazing photograph in its own right.  7 from me, and I''d love to know more about this place after the challenge! ', '2018-08-08 01:20:02.000000', NULL, 0),
