(7590935, 1222611, 194290, '<td valign="top">its a place where they do kelp (seaweed) production. i updated it in the decscription. regarding the theme, the canal is parallel and never meets in reality, but appears to meet in the pic and hence i choose this entry as i wanted something different to the routine pics we will get to see of a vanishing point. Thank you for the comment.<table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> What am I looking at????? Clearly not a rice paddy... Really beautiful. For me, though, while a magnificent image, this is not an example of "vanishing point" </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'its a place where they do kelp (seaweed) production. i updated it in the decscription. regarding the theme, the canal is parallel and never meets in reality, but appears to meet in the pic and hence i choose this entry as i wanted something different to the routine pics we will get to see of a vanishing point. Thank you for the comment.Originally posted by tanguera: What am I looking at????? Clearly not a rice paddy... Really beautiful. For me, though, while a magnificent image, this is not an example of "vanishing point" ', '2018-08-08 01:27:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7590937, 1222611, 194290, '<td valign="top">thank you, i was there waiting for like an hour just for some person or a boat to come in to the frame, and towards the end lot of fishermen were there. i choose this frame as single person is making it more interesting than few of them <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JulietNN:</b></div><hr/><i> 10 and front page, this is amazing and that extra point is for the person, who just makes the whole picture a story. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'thank you, i was there waiting for like an hour just for some person or a boat to come in to the frame, and towards the end lot of fishermen were there. i choose this frame as single person is making it more interesting than few of them Originally posted by JulietNN: 10 and front page, this is amazing and that extra point is for the person, who just makes the whole picture a story. ', '2018-08-08 01:29:01.000000', NULL, 0),
